        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International PH-4883, Ridges at Edge Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Ridged Door Pull is a unique piece for a modern space. Made by RK International, this funky piece will bring an ultra-modern feel to any door. It has a since of movement that is sometimes lost on the sharp lines of modern hardware. It is available in satin nickel, polished nickel, antique english, and oil rubbed bronze finishes. Choose from a 12 inch or an 18 inch center to center.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/modern-ridged-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-883\"><b>Modern Ridged Cabinet Pull</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-ridged-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-784\"><b>Modern Ridged Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>PH-4883</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 13-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PH-4884</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 20-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged Standard with Thrubolt mounting (bolts through the door). Also available matching <a href=\"/products/ridges-at-edge-door-pulls-pair-rk-international-ph-4902bm\">Pair Ridges at Edge Door Pulls Back to Back Mounted</a> door pulls for both sides of a door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
