                "description": "RK International PH-4883 Modern Ridged Door Pull - The Modern Ridged Door Pull is a unique piece for a modern space. Made by RK International, this funky piece will bring an ultra-modern feel to any door. It has a since of movement that is sometimes lost on the sharp lines of modern hardware. It is available in satin nickel, polished nickel, antique english, and oil rubbed bronze finishes. Choose from a 12 inch or an 18 inch center to center.",
